    "Noun" : {

    },
    "On Review, words you are learning come back at set times. Each card shows a sentence from one of your videos. Come back whenever the number beside Review is above zero." : {

    },
    "On Videos, drop a video file you own. The first time, pick a speech model and let it download once; the sizes are shown next to each choice." : {

    },
    "On Videos, each video shows how much of it you already know, such as 91% known · Comfortable. It counts the nouns, verbs, adjectives and adverbs you know. Small words like articles and particles aren't kept; they make up about half of what is said and are nearly always known, so the share you really understand is higher than the figure. About 90% of the words that are kept is roughly 95% of everything, which is around where following along gets comfortable." : {

    },
    "On Words, the words from your videos are listed by how often they appear. Select the ones you want to learn and press Start learning, or mark the ones you already know." : {

    },
    "Open a video's Info to see the commonest words you don't know yet, and start learning them all at once." : {

