    "Reprise" : {

    },
    "Reprise is free software under the MIT licence." : {

    },
    "Reprise listens to the video on this Mac and writes out what is said, with times. This is the long step. In our tests the medium model took about 3 minutes for a 10 minute video on an Apple silicon Mac; larger models are slower." : {

    },
    "Reprise uses spaced repetition: a word you get right comes back after a longer wait each time, and one you miss comes back sooner. A word you are learning moves through these stages:" : {

