    "You stopped at %@." : {

    },
    "You'll see the same circle beside a word on the Words page, in its panel and in the video. It fills as the word moves up, from red through yellow to green, and becomes a white disc once it is finished. An empty ring is a new word, and a green tick is a word you marked known." : {

    },
    "Your original file is only ever read, never changed or deleted. Reprise works on a copy and keeps a smaller one for playback. While a video is being added, its row says which step it is on, such as 4 of 7 · Transcribing. If you chose to go ahead despite a language warning, the language check is skipped and there are 6 steps." : {

